{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38629","headline":"醮词 · 李沇","name":"醮词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"犬咬天关闭，彩童呼僊吏。\n一封红篆书，爲奏尘寰事。\n八极鳌柱倾，四溟龙鬣沸。\n长庚冷有芒，文曲澹无气。\n乌轮不再中，黄沙瘗腥鬼。\n请帝命真官，临云啓金匮。\n方与清华宫，重正紫极位。\n旷古雨露恩，安得惜沾施。\n生人血欲尽，搀抢无饱意。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李沇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}